{"4601100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "False Oath", "steam_appid": 4601100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>STORY:</u></strong><br>You are Elis, a knight of the Kingdom of Torvenia. The royal healer has summoned you and the other knights for a crucial mission. A deadly plague is spreading across the kingdom, and the royals are in grave danger. You must find the ingredients for a special potion capable of curing any ailment.<br><br>Time and the plague are against you. <strong>Can you save the Kingdom of Torvenia from this crisis?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAMEPLAY:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>False Oath</strong> is a single player retro-style survival horror game inspired by classic titles of the genre, set in a medieval era and focused on melee combat. Explore your surroundings, solve puzzles, gather resources, and survive as you uncover the truth behind the plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed camera angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >’90s retro look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee-focused combat gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful ranged weapon with limited ammunition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited healing items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive equipment upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual saving in designated areas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin